      "id": "claim_3cf6de01e790425a81003c5ba21c0814",
      "statement": "The transcriber engine is a local-first Python CLI whose orchestrator lives in transcriber/__main__.py and wires stage modules into a single batch run: pipeline -> describe_slides -> summarize (+ Notion) -> Telegram -> S3 -> cleanup.",
