      "id": "claim_246dc3eb42fd409f9780a7661c4270e4",
      "statement": "The openrouter slides backend issues one OpenRouter vision call per slide via the shared _openrouter_vision helper, is image-only (the transcript argument is accepted for protocol conformance but intentionally unused), and enforces deterministic ceilings (max slides and max total encoded bytes) that hard-fail before any HTTP call; empty slide sets resolve to an empty .slides.md with no HTTP call.",
