      "id": "claim_d067b4e6660244c58a982539b13679e8",
      "statement": "The summarize stage runs on the single agno backend selected as a pure function of config.summary.backend: two direct OpenRouter chat-completions calls produce the summary and digest, the engine writes local artifacts before publishing, the Notion subpage is published engine-side via the Notion REST API with no MCP and no model tool-calling, and a .notion_published.json sidecar prevents duplicate pages on retry.",
