      "id": "claim_07b2d7eb6c2a4c4b83372612491c0b57",
      "statement": "Backend selection is a pure function of config with no silent fallback: stages.slides.backend must be openrouter and summary.backend must be agno (both validated at config load), _get_slides_backend and get_summarize_backend raise on unknown values, and preflight requires ffmpeg always, scenedetect only when slides are enabled, aws only when S3 sync is enabled, and the openrouter section unconditionally.",
